Let's start by creating a basic Patient resource. From the PID-5 field, I'll extract the HumanName. The birthDate will come from PID-7. Here's the code:
```
Patient patient = new Patient();
HumanName humanName = new HumanName();
humanName.setFamily("Smith");
humanName.setGiven(new String[] {"John"});
patient.addName(humanName);
Instant birthDate = Instant.parse("1990-01-01T00:00:00Z");
patient.setBirthDate(birthDate);
```

From the PID-3 repeating field, I'll extract multiple identifiers. Let's add an identifier array with MRN (type MR) and SSN (type SS). Here's the code:
```
List<Identifier> identifiers = new ArrayList<>();
for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
    Identifier identifier = new Identifier();
    if (i == 0) { // MRN
        identifier.setType(Identifier.Type.MR);
        identifier.setValue("MRN-" + i);
    } else { // SSN
        identifier.setType(Identifier.Type.SSN);
        identifier.setValue("SSN-" + i);
    }
    identifiers.add(identifier);
}
patient.setMultipleIdentifiers(identifiers);
```

To add the us-core-race and us-core-ethnicity extensions, I'll use proper ombCategory coding. Here's the code:
```
Extension race = new Extension();
race.setUrl("http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/StructureDefinition/us-core-race");
CodeableConcept raceValue = new CodeableConcept();
raceValue.setCode("O12345"); // O for Other
raceValue.system = "urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.283";
race.setValue(raceValue);
patient.addExtension(race);

Extension ethnicity = new Extension();
ethnicity.setUrl("http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/StructureDefinition/us-core-ethnicity");
CodeableConcept ethnicityValue = new CodeableConcept();
ethnicityValue.setCode("W"); // W for White
ethnicityValue.system = "urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.283";
ethnicity.setValue(ethnicityValue);
patient.addExtension(ethnicity);
```

Now, let's create a Bundle of type transaction with Patient and Encounter entries, using fullUrl UUIDs for internal references. Here's the code:
```
Bundle bundle = new Bundle();
bundle.setType(Bundle.Type.TRANSACTION);

Patient patientResource = new Patient(patient);
bundle.addEntry(new Bundle.Entry().setFullUrl(UUID.randomUUID().toString()).setResource(patientResource));

Encounter encounter = new Encounter();
encounter.setStatus(Encounter.Status.IN_PROGRESS);
patientResource.addLink(new Reference(encounter));
bundle.addEntry(new Bundle.Entry().setFullUrl(UUID.randomUUID().toString()).setResource(encounter));

System.out.println(bundle.toXml());
```
